peratorname{cos}⁡x-5{sec}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575547 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "59e71a7a-5ae7-5b4a-bdd0-a27062dbab09" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575547 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-5{sec}^{2}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 5{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-5\\int {sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-5\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186575461 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1069 "q-49123" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x(6\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "aefe8a56-b826-5c47-afc1-22f96d795fb8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575586 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x(6\\operatorname{csc}⁡x-5\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (6{csc}^{2}⁡x-5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 6{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\int {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)-5(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡x)+C \\\\  & =-6\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+5\\operatorname{csc}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186575415 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1069 "q-71655" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "bd10b8fd-b17b-505d-be34-31b755b59a68" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575596 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C, \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (8\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,\\text{d}x & =8\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C \\\\  & =-8\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186575490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1069 "q-113919" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1071 "$\\int 4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f7057d32-2563-5caa-9eb0-bb4367d4b45b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186575621 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 175921860